.TH geectl-remote-staging-project 1  "geectl-remote-staging-project 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-remote\-staging\-project \- Show one staging project of a workflow project
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl remote staging\-project\fR [\fB\-\-no\-requests\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-status\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show one staging project of a workflow project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-requests\fR
Leave out the staged, untracked, and obsolete request lists
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-status\fR
Leave out the overall state of the staging project
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The workflow project the staging project belongs to
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
The staging project name
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
